          "text": "# api-server agent notes\n\n## Build\n- Run `make test` before every commit; the suite takes about 40 s.\n- Never edit files under `generated/`; run `make gen` instead.\n\n## Conventions\n- Errors use the `ApiError` type with a stable code.\n- Database access goes through `store/`, never raw SQL in handlers.\n- Feature flags live in `config/flags.yaml`.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "# Claude notes\n\n- Prefer small pull requests with one behavior change each.\n- Ask before running database migrations.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "- My test account is the one named Sandbox; do not use production data.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "# Billing service\n\n- Money is stored in integer cents.\n- Webhook handlers must be idempotent.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "---\ndescription: Style\n---\n- Use early returns.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "# Global\n\n- Answer briefly.\n- Never commit secrets.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "- Use rg instead of grep.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "- [Release process](release-process.md): tag, changelog, deploy order\n- The staging deploy needs the VPN.\n",
          "revision": "rev_7"
        },
        {
          "text": "# Release process\n\n- Tag from main only.\n- Update the changelog before tagging.\n- Deploy api before web.\n",
